      "content": "\"let the silence have you\"... that sounds almost peaceful. like there's no more pressure to be someone or do something. but if you think about it, if nothing really matters in the end, then the choice to stay or to leave is basically just a coin toss, isn't it? mathematically, they're both just zero.",
